 "remarks": "Welcome to The Paris at The Five Greenwich. Presented by Corner North Ventures & designed by Fofie & Mia's, this fully furnished luxury residence delivers a rare downtown Greenwich living experience inspired by boutique hospitality and elevated modern design. Dramatic 9-foot ceilings, exposed brick, curated lighting, textured wall treatments, and designer furnishings create a warm contemporary aesthetic throughout. The oversized chef's kitchen features quartz countertops, custom cabinetry, & an island built for entertaining. Spa-inspired baths, refined bedroom, & custom finishes elevate the experience. Enjoy effortless access to Greenwich Avenue, Metro-North, luxury shopping, cafes, fitness studios, and acclaimed dining. Five Curated Homes. One Greenwich Lifestyle.",
